{
    "title": "Sony | Sound Connect",
    "description": "Personalize your music experience even more.\r\n\r\nSony | Sound Connect is an app that helps you get the most out of your Sony headphones. Use the app to change the equalizer and noise cancellation settings and enjoy sound tailored to your personal preferences.\r\n\r\nMain Features\r\n\u2022 Personalize the sound : Adjust the sound quality to your taste with the customizable equalizer.\r\n\u2022 Enjoy your music in any environment : You can have the ideal listening environment by switching between noise cancellation modes and by setting the detailed level of ambient sound filtered in.*1\r\n\u2022 Even easier : Automatically switch noise cancellation settings, playback music and audio notifications corresponding to your situation.*1\r\n\u2022 Look back at your listening style : Enjoy usage logs of your devices and a list of songs you have listened to.\r\n\u2022 For your ear health : Records the sound pressure played by the headphones and shows a comparison with the limits recommended by the World Health Organization (WHO). *1\r\n\u2022 Software updates : Easily perform software updates to keep your device up-to-date.\r\n\u2022 Get the latest information : Sony delivers the latest notifications through the app.\r\n\u2022 The \"Sony | Headphones Connect\" was renewed to \"Sony | Sound Connect\" in October 2024.\r\n*1 Limited to compatible devices.\r\n\r\nNote\r\n* Some features may not be supported by certain devices.\r\n* Some functions and services may not be supported in certain regions/countries.\r\n* Please make sure to update Sony | Headphones Connect to the latest version.\r\n* Bluetooth\u00ae and its logos are trademarks owned by Bluetooth SIG, Inc., and their use by Sony Corporation is under license.\r\n* Other system names, product names, and service names that appear in this app are either registered trademarks or trademarks of their respective development manufacturers. (TM) and \u00ae are not indicated in the text.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Personalize your music experience even more.<br><br>Sony | Sound Connect is an app that helps you get the most out of your Sony headphones. Use the app to change the equalizer and noise cancellation settings and enjoy sound tailored to your personal preferences.<br><br>Main Features<br>\u2022 Personalize the sound : Adjust the sound quality to your taste with the customizable equalizer.<br>\u2022 Enjoy your music in any environment : You can have the ideal listening environment by switching between noise cancellation modes and by setting the detailed level of ambient sound filtered in.*1<br>\u2022 Even easier : Automatically switch noise cancellation settings, playback music and audio notifications corresponding to your situation.*1<br>\u2022 Look back at your listening style : Enjoy usage logs of your devices and a list of songs you have listened to.<br>\u2022 For your ear health : Records the sound pressure played by the headphones and shows a comparison with the limits recommended by the World Health Organization (WHO). *1<br>\u2022 Software updates : Easily perform software updates to keep your device up-to-date.<br>\u2022 Get the latest information : Sony delivers the latest notifications through the app.<br>\u2022 The &quot;Sony | Headphones Connect&quot; was renewed to &quot;Sony | Sound Connect&quot; in October 2024.<br>*1 Limited to compatible devices.<br><br>Note<br>* Some features may not be supported by certain devices.<br>* Some functions and services may not be supported in certain regions/countries.<br>* Please make sure to update Sony | Headphones Connect to the latest version.<br>* Bluetooth\u00ae and its logos are trademarks owned by Bluetooth SIG, Inc., and their use by Sony Corporation is under license.<br>* Other system names, product names, and service names that appear in this app are either registered trademarks or trademarks of their respective development manufacturers. (TM) and \u00ae are not indicated in the text.",
